ild a wall and make the walkers pay  for it oh maybe this is just a cool  visual effect either way this represents  a truly epic battle the Song of Ice and  Fire that the book series is named for  but is this really how Game of Thrones  will end after seven seasons of human  drama and intricate politics will the  end be a fantasy battle where the good  guys beetle the bad guys the series  creators have said it'll be more complex  than that and there is some dark strange  stuff in the prophecies and lore of  Thrones like legend says that last time  the White Walkers attacked they were  defeated by a hero who sacrificed his  beloved wife so maybe John will kill  Daenerys and there are hints of  cooperation and even marriage between  humans and White Walkers  maybe Westeros will make a deal with the  Walkers maybe Jon will become the new  night king maybe that's what the frozen  direwolf means there are lots of  possibilities so the final season of  Thrones won't have time for much  politics or minor characters or travel  times making sense it'll be more Fire  and Ice and CGI but there are still big  shocks and revelations to come mysteries  will be uncovered prophecies will be  fulfilled claw gains will Bowl and  characters we love will die because the  story has nothing to lose now this is  what it's been building up to there are  just six episodes left we'll be covering  lots of Game of Thrones content from now  to the finale so check out our videos  and subscribe and click the bell during  season eight we'll do a video for each  episode as well as weekly live streams  for patrons if you want to support alt  shift X and get extra updates live  streams and behind the scenes stuff sign  up at the patreon link below this  artwork is by attached LT knows he's  gotten heaps of great speculative  Thrones art so go check him out thanks  to patrons Tracey Wynans Dylan J Roebuck  Zachary Bain Abhishek rau Anthony Mackie  dobro Deep lured and Mellie  of Cheers  you
 

